WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.538
Once the patient-admission interface exists later
reports can start from it This

00:00:06.551 --> 00:00:12.065
query groups the reusable admission rows by
department The report

00:00:12.091 --> 00:00:18.225
author does not need to repeat patient joins or
stay-duration calculations That

00:00:18.238 --> 00:00:24.172
is the value of modular SQL stable logic is
centralized and consumer queries become smaller
